Before you start playing you can tap on TPP or FPP and choose between playing in the third or first person. Both have their advantages, playing in third person you will be able to have more control of what happens around you, and playing in first person you will be more precise in your plays.
If you feel that your game is slow, or you have fps drops, proof lower graphics quality. You may lose definition but we can assure you that your game will go much better.
In the configuration wheel, go to the option «peek and fire»And activate it. It will permit you look in third person perspective being in first, being able to alternate.
It is an option in the basic menu, which allows you shoot with the left side while aiming with the right. If you do not have it activated, you will find yourself shooting and pointing with the same hand and that will make it a more difficult task.
Also in basic configuration, you can choose to enable the option «Auto open doors»To make things easier for you. Building doors will open automatically without you having to interact.
In this options section you can adjust cursor size as of the items that you may have. You can adjust the location of the shutter button to make you comfortable, or for example, the size of the medicine cabinets or grenades so that they are easily accessible.
