What restrictions do you have when migrating from the Kingdom?
So you ask yourself, why?
If the Kingdom you want to move to has less than 90 days of existence you can not migrate to this.
You can migrate to a kingdom that has less than 90 days of existence as long as this kingdom is senior than yours today.
