Their plight emerges from the backdrop of a sensationalist and uncritical media, adulation for those transitioning on transgender websites, and transgender school programmes. Hormonal and surgical treatment for gender dysphoria is not dissimilar: it is an intrusion on the brain and body in the hope of improving ‘happiness’ that enjoys no scientific basis.
