ARE THERE ANY OTHER CLINICAL PROBLEMS ASSOCIATED WITH GENDER DYSPHORIA?
Proponents of affirmative treatment proclaim the latter and declare an “alarmingly high rate” of self-harm and suicide attempts, exemplified by highly publicised and tragic youth suicides in the US (33). As with most data related to gender dysphoria in children, studies are limited by lack of numbers and methodological bias, and the true rate of self-harm due to external ostracism is unknown.
